---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="錦乃｜ACHIEVEMENTS｜掲載・活動実績"
  description="江戸城復元プロジェクト、小江戸川越一番街など国内外メディア掲載・活動実績。"
>

<section class="bg-[#faf8f3] min-h-screen">

  <!-- =========================================================
       HERO
  ========================================================== -->

  <section class="relative h-[820px] overflow-hidden">

    <img
      src="/images/achievements-bg.jpg"
      alt="活動実績"
      class="achievement-hero-bg absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover select-none pointer-events-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </section>


  <!-- =========================================================
       ACHIEVEMENTS CONTENT
       wash-bg1.png をこのページ全体の背景として統合
  ========================================================== -->

  <div class="relative overflow-hidden">

    <!-- Large Washi Background -->

    <img
      src="/images/washi-bg1.png"
      alt=""
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />


    <!-- =========================================================
         INTRODUCTION
    ========================================================== -->

    <section
      class="
        relative
        overflow-hidden
        py-14
        sm:py-16
        lg:py-20
      "
    >

      <div
        class="
          relative
          mx-auto
          max-w-7xl
          px-5
          sm:px-8
          lg:px-10
        "
      >

        <p
          class="
            text-[10px]
            tracking-[0.4em]
            text-rose-500/80
          "
        >
          ACHIEVEMENTS
        </p>


        <h1
          class="
            mt-3
            text-4xl
            leading-tight
            text-white
          "
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          歩んできた軌跡
        </h1>


        <p
          class="
            mt-6
            max-w-3xl
            text-sm
            leading-7
            text-white/90
          "
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          制作した作品が国内外のニュースサイト、
          SNS、YouTubeなどで紹介されるなど、
          多くの方に知っていただく機会が増えてまいりました。

          <br /><br />

          このページでは、
          これまでの掲載実績や活動を
          時系列でまとめています。
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================================
         ACHIEVEMENT LIST
    ========================================================== -->

    <section
      class="
        relative
        min-h-screen
        overflow-hidden
        py-10
        sm:py-12
        lg:py-16
      "
    >

      <div
        class="
          relative
          mx-auto
          max-w-7xl
          px-5
          sm:px-8
          lg:px-10
        "
      >

        <div
          class="
            grid
            items-start
            gap-5
            md:grid-cols-2
            xl:grid-cols-3
            sm:gap-6
          "
        >


          <!-- =================================================
               CARD 01
          ================================================== -->

          <article
            class="
              overflow-hidden
              rounded-[1.25rem]
              border
              border-white/60
              bg-white/90
              backdrop-blur-sm
              transition
              duration-500
              hover:-translate-y-1
              hover:shadow-xl
              sm:rounded-[1.5rem]
            "
          >

            <div class="achievement-media">

              <blockquote class="twitter-tweet">
                <a href="https://x.com/MikuNiki5471/status/1904832266984976533"></a>
              </blockquote>

            </div>


            <div class="p-5 sm:p-6">

              <p
                class="
                  text-[10px]
                  tracking-[0.3em]
                  text-neutral-500
                "
                style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
              >
                2025 / 04 / 11
              </p>


              <h2
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xl
                  leading-tight
                  text-neutral-900
                "
                style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
              >
                小江戸川越一番街<br />
                蔵造りの町並み
              </h2>


              <p
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xs
                  text-neutral-500
                "
              >
                世界中で紹介された最初の作品
              </p>


              <details class="achievement-details mt-5">

                <summary>続きを読む</summary>

                <div
                  class="
                    mt-5
                    text-xs
                    leading-6
                    text-neutral-700
                  "
                  style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
                >

                  埼玉県川越市幸町、
                  <strong>
                    小江戸川越一番街商店街 蔵造りの町並み
                  </strong>
                  を実在する本物をもとに再現した作品です。

                  <br /><br />

                  明治時代から続く町並みや建築様式、
                  屋根・格子・瓦・石畳まで細部を制作し、
                  投稿した作品は日本のニュースサイト
                  「ねとらぼ」をはじめ、
                  国内外の多数のメディアで紹介されました。

                </div>

              </details>


              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">

                <a
                  href="https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/cont/articles/3398021/"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  ニュース記事
                </a>


                <a
                  href="https://x.com/MikuNiki5471/status/1904832266984976533"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  X投稿
                </a>

              </div>

            </div>

          </article>


          <!-- =================================================
               CARD 02
          ================================================== -->

          <article
            class="
              overflow-hidden
              rounded-[1.25rem]
              border
              border-white/60
              bg-white/90
              backdrop-blur-sm
              transition
              duration-500
              hover:-translate-y-1
              hover:shadow-xl
              sm:rounded-[1.5rem]
            "
          >

            <div class="achievement-media">

              <iframe
                class="aspect-video w-full"
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vALpinxBdxM"
                title="江戸城復元プロジェクト"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>

            </div>


            <div class="p-5 sm:p-6">

              <p
                class="
                  text-[10px]
                  tracking-[0.3em]
                  text-neutral-500
                "
                style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
              >
                2025 / 06 / 24
              </p>


              <h2
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xl
                  leading-tight
                  text-neutral-900
                "
                style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
              >
                江戸城<br />
                復元プロジェクト
              </h2>


              <p
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xs
                  text-neutral-500
                "
              >
                国内外で二度目の大型メディア掲載
              </p>


              <details class="achievement-details mt-5">

                <summary>続きを読む</summary>

                <div
                  class="
                    mt-5
                    text-xs
                    leading-6
                    text-neutral-700
                  "
                  style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
                >

                  東京都千代田区千代田一帯に広がっていた
                  <strong>江戸城</strong>
                  を、
                  歴史資料・古地図・古写真・発掘成果・文献などをもとに
                  デジタル空間で復元している長期プロジェクトです。

                  <br /><br />

                  制作範囲は皇居東御苑だけではなく、
                  本丸・二の丸・三の丸・西の丸・吹上御苑、
                  外郭や城下まで含めた広大な江戸城空間を対象としています。

                  <br /><br />

                  制作途中の様子を紹介したYouTube動画は、
                  日本のニュースサイト「ねとらぼ」をはじめ、
                  国内外のメディアで紹介されました。

                </div>

              </details>


              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">

                <a
                  href="https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/cont/articles/3431502/"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  ニュース記事
                </a>


                <a
                  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vALpinxBdxM"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  YouTube
                </a>

              </div>

            </div>

          </article>


          <!-- ===============
               CARD 03
          ==================== -->

          <article
            class="
              overflow-hidden
              rounded-[1.25rem]
              border
              border-white/60
              bg-white/90
              backdrop-blur-sm
              transition
              duration-500
              hover:-translate-y-1
              hover:shadow-xl
              sm:rounded-[1.5rem]
            "
          >

            <div class="achievement-media">

              <iframe
                class="aspect-video w-full"
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/cJjq_H8yJ_8"
                title="アマテラス鯖 無限城"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>

            </div>


            <div class="p-5 sm:p-6">

              <p
                class="
                  text-[10px]
                  tracking-[0.3em]
                  text-neutral-500
                "
                style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
              >
                2026 / 03 / 31
              </p>


              <h2
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xl
                  leading-tight
                  text-neutral-900
                "
                style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
              >
                アマテラス鯖<br />
                大規模建築企画　無限城
              </h2>


              <p
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xs
                  text-neutral-500
                "
              >
                初の大型企画への提供
              </p>


              <details class="achievement-details mt-5">

                <summary>続きを読む</summary>

                <div
                  class="
                    mt-5
                    text-xs
                    leading-6
                    text-neutral-700
                  "
                  style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
                >

                  Minecraftサーバー
                  <strong>アマテラス鯖</strong>
                  公式チャンネルで展開される
                  サバイバル大規模建築企画において、

                  人気作品「鬼滅の刃」に登場する
                  <strong>無限城</strong>
                  の建築設計制作に携わりました。

                  <br /><br />

                  『鬼滅の刃』に登場する無限城は
                  空間が上下左右に連続する独創的な構造を持つ表現が特徴の大舞台。

                  <br /><br />

                  原作の迫力を再現し制作を終えた後の無限城は、
                  アマテラス鯖公式YouTube動画内の
                  サバイバル大規模建築企画の動画のひとつとして公開されています。

                  <br /><br />

                </div>

              </details>


              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">

                <a
                  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cJjq_H8yJ_8"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  動画
                </a>


                <a
                  href="https://www.youtube.com/@AMATERAS_SMP"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  アマテラス鯖公式チャンネル
                </a>

              </div>

            </div>

          </article>


        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ===============
         BOTTOM
    ========== -->

    <section
      class="
        relative
        mx-auto
        max-w-7xl
        px-5
        py-14
        sm:px-8
        sm:py-16
        lg:px-10
        lg:py-20
      "
    >

      <div
        class="
          rounded-[1.5rem]
          border
          border-white/60
          bg-white/85
          p-7
          text-center
          backdrop-blur-sm
          sm:rounded-[2rem]
          sm:p-10
        "
      >

        <p
          class="
            text-[10px]
            tracking-[0.3em]
            text-neutral-500
          "
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          NEXT CHAPTER
        </p>


        <h2
          class="
            mt-3
            text-2xl
            text-neutral-900
          "
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          これからも歩み続けます。
        </h2>


        <p
          class="
            mx-auto
            mt-5
            max-w-3xl
            text-sm
            leading-7
            text-neutral-700
          "
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          城郭・歴史的建築・町並みの再現を中心に、
          更なる新しい作品制作や発信活動を続けていきます。
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>

  </div>

</section>


<script
  async
  src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js"
  charset="utf-8"
></script>


<style>

.achievement-media iframe {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  height: auto;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.achievement-media:has(.twitter-tweet) {
  aspect-ratio: auto;
  overflow: visible;
  background: #fff;
}

.achievement-media .twitter-tweet {
  margin: 0 auto !important;
}

/* =========================================================
   DISPLAY COLOR PROTECTION
   PCとスマホ実機で同じ表示を維持
   ※サイズ・レイアウトは変更しない
========================================================= */

:global(html) {
  color-scheme: light;
}

:global(body) {
  color-scheme: light;
  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
}


/* =========================================================
   ACHIEVEMENTS PAGE
========================================================= */

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] {
  color-scheme: light;
}


/* =========================================================
   INTRODUCTION
========================================================= */

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > section:nth-child(2) {
  color-scheme: light;
}

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > section:nth-child(2) h1 {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > section:nth-child(2) > div > p:first-child {
  color: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.8) !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.8);
}

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > section:nth-child(2) > div > p:last-child {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9) !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
}


/* =========================================================
   ACHIEVEMENT CARDS
========================================================= */

.achievement-media + div {
  color-scheme: light;
}


/* Card itself */

.achievement-media + div {
  background-color: #ffffff;
}


/* =========================================================
   CARD DATE
========================================================= */

.achievement-media + div > p:first-child {
  color: #737373 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
}


/* =========================================================
   CARD TITLE
========================================================= */

.achievement-media + div h2 {
  color: #171717 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
}


/* =========================================================
   CARD SUBTITLE
========================================================= */

.achievement-media + div h2 + p {
  color: #737373 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
}


/* =========================================================
   DETAILS
========================================================= */

.achievement-details {
  color: #171717;
}

.achievement-details summary {
  color: #171717 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
}

.achievement-details > div {
  color: #404040 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #404040;
}

.achievement-details strong {
  color: #171717 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
}


/* =========================================================
   CARD BUTTONS
========================================================= */

.achievement-media + div a {
  color: #262626 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #262626;

  background-color: transparent !important;

  border-color: #d4d4d4 !important;
}

.achievement-media + div a:hover {
  background-color: #171717 !important;
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* =========================================================
   BOTTOM / NEXT CHAPTER
========================================================= */

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child {
  color-scheme: light;
}


/* Bottom card */

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child > div {
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) !important;
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) !important;
}


/* NEXT CHAPTER */

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child p:first-child {
  color: #737373 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
}


/* Bottom heading */

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child h2 {
  color: #171717 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
}


/* Bottom description */

section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child p:last-child {
  color: #404040 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #404040;
}


/* =========================================================
   CARD / BORDER COLOR PROTECTION
========================================================= */

.achievement-media + div {
  forced-color-adjust: none;
  -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
}


/* =========================================================
   REAL SMARTPHONE
   色だけをPC表示に固定
   サイズ・配置は変更しない
========================================================= */

@media (max-width: 639px) {

  .achievement-media + div,
  .achievement-media + div p,
  .achievement-media + div h2,
  .achievement-media + div summary,
  .achievement-media + div div,
  .achievement-media + div strong,
  .achievement-media + div a,
  section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > section:nth-child(2) h1,
  section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > section:nth-child(2) p,
  section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child > div,
  section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child p,
  section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child h2 {
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* Card */

  .achievement-media + div {
    background-color: #ffffff !important;
    border-color: transparent;
  }


  /* Date */

  .achievement-media + div > p:first-child {
    color: #737373 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
  }


  /* Title */

  .achievement-media + div h2 {
    color: #171717 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
  }


  /* Subtitle */

  .achievement-media + div h2 + p {
    color: #737373 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
  }


  /* Details */

  .achievement-details summary {
    color: #171717 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
  }

  .achievement-details > div {
    color: #404040 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #404040;
  }

  .achievement-details strong {
    color: #171717 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
  }


  /* Buttons */

  .achievement-media + div a {
    color: #262626 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #262626;
    background-color: transparent !important;
    border-color: #d4d4d4 !important;
  }


  /* Bottom card */

  section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child > div {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) !important;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) !important;
  }

  section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child p:first-child {
    color: #737373 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
  }

  section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child h2 {
    color: #171717 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
  }

  section.bg-\[\#faf8f3\] > div.relative > section:last-child p:last-child {
    color: #404040 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #404040;
  }

}

</style>


</Layout>